# Thrascias wildlife and plants. The reagents' physical descriptions come from the base game.

ent-WFMobThrasciasPenguin = tundra penguin
    .desc = A thick-feathered penguin that waddles over the snow as if the cold were nothing. It doesn't mind you.

ent-WFMobThrasciasSnowFox = snow fox
    .desc = A white fox with a coat the colour of the drifts. Leave it alone and it will leave you alone.

ent-WFMobThrasciasFrostBear = frost bear
    .desc = A huge white bear that hunts across the pack ice. It attacks anything that comes near.

ent-WFMobThrasciasYeti = yeti
    .desc = A towering, shaggy white ape, slow on its feet and far stronger than you. It won't start a fight, but it will finish one.

ent-WFMobThrasciasCrystalCrab = crystal crab
    .desc = A crab grown from frozen plasma, pale blue and brittle. Break it open and the crystal inside spills out.

ent-WFMobThrasciasSnowSpider = snow spider
    .desc = A pale spider the colour of ash and frost. Its bite carries a sedative.

ent-WFFrostbelleBloom = frostbelle bloom
    .desc = A pale blue bloom, cold to the touch. Eaten, it dulls pain and slows you for a few seconds.

ent-WFFrozenFungus = frozen fungus
    .desc = A hard, pale fungus pulled out from under the snow. Cook two with water in a big bowl and you get a warming soup.

ent-WFFoodSoupFrozenFungus = warming fungus soup
    .desc = A thick soup of frozen fungus. It warms you from the inside out.

ent-WFFloraFrostbelle = frostbelle
    .desc = A hardy blue flower that grows in the snow. Pick the blooms and eat them to numb pain, though they leave you slow.

ent-WFFloraIceCrystal = ice crystal
    .desc = A cluster of clear crystal frozen into the ice. A pickaxe or shovel will chip shards off it, and it grows back.

ent-WFFloraCrystalBloom = crystal bloom
    .desc = A plant that grows glowing crystal fruit. You can pick a shard from it.

ent-WFFloraFrozenFungus = frozen fungus
    .desc = A pale fungus growing under the snow drifts. It can be picked and cooked.

ent-WFFloraWhipvine = whipvine
    .desc = A thorny vine that lashes out at anything that walks past, hard enough to knock you down. Cut it with a knife for fibre.

ent-WFFloraFrostPod = frost pod
    .desc = A swollen pod, white with rime. Come too close and it bursts into a cloud of freezing mist.

reagent-name-wf-frostbelle-chill = frostbelle chill
reagent-desc-wf-frostbelle-chill = The sap of a frostbelle. It numbs and slows whoever takes it.

reagent-name-wf-warm-broth = warm broth
reagent-desc-wf-warm-broth = A rich broth that heats the body and eases the damage cold has done.

wf-flora-whipvine-lash = { CAPITALIZE(THE($plant)) } whips across your legs!
wf-flora-frostpod-burst = The frost pod bursts in a cloud of freezing mist!
